  "limitations": [
    "Relative shared-star direction/scale checks only. SMASH publisher WCS is the absolute sky anchor, not independently verified absolute astrometry.",
    "Fitted direction is empirically checked inside the matched hull; no claim outside it.",
    "SMASH reciprocal gate uses the VISTA image pair and is not an independent absolute solution.",
    "Composed survey band images carry the exact hips2fits/atlas TAN request grid. One of them, Herschel SPIRE 250, is qualified only by transfer from an identically gridded composite that passed the catalogue gate."
  ]
